    "goal": "Render a 4-card editorial feature grid below the reviews strip explaining why Pococo feels different at night. Desktop renders all 4 cards as equal-width columns in one row (grid-cols-4, gap-32); mobile stacks them into a single column (grid-cols-1, gap-24). Each card carries an image (aspect 296/187), a Satoshi h5 title, and a Funnel Sans body paragraph. Section heading is a centered h2 (max-width 592px) with a tertiary-color subheading.",
